   <narrative xml:lang="SV">twin fas1 Migr LIT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">twin phase1 Migr LIT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Migrationsverket avser formulera f&#xF6;rslag f&#xF6;r ett twinning-projekt i Litauen. Projektet ing&#xE5;r i Phare 2002 (LI2002/IB/JH/01, Migration and Asylum Management System). F&#xF6;rslaget kommer att utformas tillsammans med Danmark (Udlaendingestyrelsen) med Migrationsverket som lead, dvs MV kommer att f&#xF6;resl&#xE5; en PAA f&#xF6;r projektet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Migration Board will prepare a proposal for a EU/Phare twinning project in Lithuania (LI2002/IB/JH/01, Migration and Asylum Management System), together with the Danish Migration Board as junior partner. The project will be presented in Vilnius in april 2002.</narrative>
  </description>
